- the layout toggle, two buttons `Unified` and `Split`. The layout is `Unified` at startup; a
  change applies to every diff shown and lasts until pi-dent quits;
- in the panel mode `File`, the file display toggle, two buttons `Full file` and
  `Changes only`;
- in the panel mode `File`, for the selected entry: its `path`; the comparison of the table
